# Identity Echo: "{3}{R}: Exile target creature or planeswalker you control. Reveal cards from the top of your library
# until you reveal a creature or planeswalker card. Put that card onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of
# your library in a random order." Turn 1 puts Ornithopter and Identity Echo out; on turn 3 (a main phase with an empty
# stack, so sorcery speed is met) the ability exiles the Ornithopter. The library, after the Forest drawn for the turn,
# is Forest, Forest, Llanowar Elves, Plains, Plains: the two Forests are revealed with the Elves, the Elves (the first
# creature card) enter untapped, and the two Forests (identical, so their random order cannot matter) go to the bottom.

